# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vienna Housing Finder — Environment Variables Example
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# ⚠️  This is a template file. DO NOT put real secrets here.
#
# How to use:
#   1. Copy this file to `.env` (or use `wrangler secret put`)
#   2. Fill in your real values
#   3. NEVER commit the real `.env` file to Git
#
# For Cloudflare Workers deployment, use `wrangler secret put` for
# sensitive values instead of a `.env` file (see README).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─── Telegram Bot ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get this from @BotFather on Telegram:
#   1. Open Telegram → search for @BotFather
#   2. Send /newbot and follow instructions
#   3. Copy the token (looks like: 123456789:ABCdefGhIJKlmNoPQRsTUVwxyZ)
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_telegram_bot_token_here

# ─── TypeSafe AI (Jev Engine) ────────────────────────────────────
# Get this from https://typesafe.ai/
#   1. Sign up / log in
#   2. Go to dashboard → API keys
#   3. Copy your API key
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=your_typesafe_api_key_here

# ─── Willhaben Search URL ────────────────────────────────────────
# The URL of the Willhaben search results page you want to scrape.
# You can customize filters (price, area, etc.) directly in the URL.
# This example: Vienna apartments under 550 EUR.
WILLHABEN_URL=https://www.willhaben.at/iad/immobilien/mietwohnungen/mietwohnung-angebote?sfId=f224226b-34c5-44e5-a64c-a2da4261f249&isNavigation=true&areaId=900&rows=90&PRICE_TO=550

# ─── Worker URL (after deployment) ───────────────────────────────
# After you run `wrangler deploy`, Cloudflare will give you a URL like:
#   https://vienna-housing.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev
# Paste that URL here. It's used in the Telegram bot's "Dashboard"
# button and in cron-job.org configurations.
WORKER_URL=https://your-worker-name.your-subdomain.workers.dev
